{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27617","headline":"寓怀寄苏州刘郎中 · 张祜","name":"寓怀寄苏州刘郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一闻周召佐明时，西望都门强策羸。\n天子好文才自薄，诸侯力荐命犹奇。\n贺知章口徒劳说，孟浩然身更不疑。\n唯是胜游行未遍，欲离京国尚迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}